-- Issue #578: seed scholarship_limits from data/scholarshipLimits.json
-- (95 rows: 19 app sports x 5 divisions). See data/scholarshipLimits.README.md
-- for sourcing, the 2025-26 House v. NCAA roster-limit context, and the
-- documented sex/gender-representative-value limitation (schema has no
-- sex column, so rows with a men's/women's split pick one figure and note
-- the other). Idempotent — re-running updates existing rows to match the
-- seed file rather than erroring on the (sport, division) unique constraint.

on conflict (sport, division) do update set
  total = excluded.total,
  head_count = excluded.head_count,
  equivalency = excluded.equivalency,
  notes = excluded.notes;
